 USDT"},"getAllSmartDeposits(bool)":{"notice":"List of all smart deposits (user + struct), only Pending or all."},"getAllSmartRequests(bool)":{"notice":"Receive all smart requests at once: both deposits and withdrawals."},"getAllSmartWithdraws(bool)":{"notice":"List of all smart conclusions (user + struct), only Pending or all."},"minSkimGainBps()":{"notice":"Threshold for HWM skim, increase in WL GROSS price in bps"},"ownerFeeSnapshotUSDT()":{"notice":"Snapshot of the “collected” commission (fee) in USDT — for analytical purposes only"},"partnerFeeBps()":{"notice":"WL owner fee (HWM fee), in bps (e.g., 3000 = 30%)"},"principalTreasury()":{"notice":"WL owner treasury (receives commission in DSF LP)"},"setFutureIncomeSource(address)":{"notice":"Set the source of future income (DSF / strategy / analytics)"},"setSettleIndex(uint128)":{"notice":"It is recommended to change settleIndex only when WL is empty (see commented require)."},"settleIndex()":{"notice":"Settle token index (0..2) — default USDT (usually 2)"},"skimFeeInDsfLp()":{"notice":"Manual HWM skim: transfer accumulated commission in DSF LP to treasury"},"sweep(address,address,uint256)":{"notice":"Emergency sweep of all tokens except DSF LP and pool tokens"},"totalFutureIncomeUsersUSDT()":{"notice":"NET future income of all WL users (after WL fee), in USDT"},"totalHoldings()":{"notice":"NET total holdings of all WL users in USDT"},"userAvailableWithdraw(address)":{"notice":"Current NET value of the user (what can be withdrawn now) in USDT"},"userAvailableWithdrawPerToken(address)":{"notice":"Current NET value of the user based on three tokens (DAI/USDC/USDT)"},"userData(address)":{"notice":"Full snapshot per user: WL balance, deposit body, NAV, future income, tokens, approvals, ETH balance, entire history, and smart requests."},"userDepositBody(address)":{"notice":"User deposit amount in USDT"},"userFutureIncomeUSDT(address)":{"notice":"Future income of a specific user (NET, after WL fees) in USDT"},"userIncom